2025-08-03 16:16:18 [deepseek-chat] A basic interface in C might look like:
2025-08-03 16:16:18 [deepseek-chat] define UART_BASE 0x1f000000  // Example base address
2025-08-03 16:16:18 [deepseek-chat] typedef struct {
2025-08-03 16:16:18 [deepseek-chat]     volatile uint32_t data;    // Data register
2025-08-03 16:16:18 [deepseek-chat]     volatile uint32_t status;  // Status register
2025-08-03 16:16:18 [deepseek-chat]     volatile uint32_t control; // Control register
2025-08-03 16:16:18 [deepseek-chat] } UART_Registers;
2025-08-03 16:16:18 [deepseek-chat] void uart_putc(char c) {
