2025-08-04 08:19:36 [deepseek-chat] 1. Zero-copy transfers via `Transferable`
2025-08-04 08:19:36 [deepseek-chat] 2. Batched sends reduce message passing overhead
2025-08-04 08:19:36 [deepseek-chat] 3. Automatic flushing on newlines or buffer full
2025-08-04 08:19:36 [deepseek-chat] 4. Memory efficient pre-allocated buffers
