2025-08-04 08:21:25 [nitro@ryzen5] so transfer ownership of a new uint8buffer that typically fulls with 1024 serial port writes
2025-08-04 08:21:41 [deepseek-chat] Yes! For efficient transfer of buffered serial port data (1024-byte chunks) from worker to host via
2025-08-04 08:21:41 [deepseek-chat] ownership transfer:
2025-08-04 08:21:41 [deepseek-chat] • Key Concept*
2025-08-04 08:21:41 [deepseek-chat] When the Uint8Array buffer fills with 1024 serial writes, transfer its `ArrayBuffer` directly to
2025-08-04 08:21:41 [deepseek-chat] avoid copies. The worker relinquishes access, and the host gains exclusive ownership.
