2025-08-04 12:40:37 [gemini-2.5-flash-preview] invocation (`invoke`).
2025-08-04 12:40:37 [gemini-2.5-flash-preview] 2.  Loaders (`ajar.cpp`/`ajar.h`, `wloader.cpp`/`wloader.h`):
