2025-08-05 20:08:35 [claude-sonnet-4] R3000A was paired with custom Graphics Processing Unit (GPU) and Sound Processing Unit (SPU) chips
2025-08-05 20:08:35 [claude-sonnet-4] to create Sony's breakthrough gaming system.
