2025-08-08 10:46:41 [gpt-5-mini] clarifications requested.
2025-08-08 10:46:41 [gpt-5-mini] - Use same API key unless you need isolation (billing/quota).
2025-08-08 10:46:41 [gpt-5-mini] 8) Minimal rollout strategy
2025-08-08 10:46:41 [gpt-5-mini] - Start with a conservative persona (e.g., "cautious-minimal") for one model.
2025-08-08 10:46:41 [gpt-5-mini] - Run small sample set (n=50–200) and review outputs manually.
