2025-08-08 10:49:09 [gpt-5-mini] Admin UI / CLI & workflow
2025-08-08 10:49:09 [gpt-5-mini] - Provide CLI stubs: /persona list (read only), /persona set <model> <id> (updates mapping in roha
2025-08-08 10:49:09 [gpt-5-mini] but not personas.json), /persona reload (reloads personas.json).
2025-08-08 10:49:09 [gpt-5-mini] - Disallow /persona edit unless running a privileged mode (requires a file edit/PR).
2025-08-08 10:49:09 [gpt-5-mini] Testing
2025-08-08 10:49:09 [gpt-5-mini] - Unit tests to ensure: (a) persona load/validation, (b) composition order, (c) session override
