2025-08-08 13:14:43 [claude-sonnet-4] 1. Leverages existing patterns - uses the existing `endpoint.reset()` mechanism
2025-08-08 13:14:43 [claude-sonnet-4] 2. Provider-specific handling - each provider can implement file flushing as needed
