2025-08-08 18:19:08 [claude-sonnet-4] - 𓍼𓈖 𓊹𓉐 (sš ḥw.t-nṯr) - "temple scribe"
2025-08-08 18:19:08 [claude-sonnet-4] - V009 appears on scribal palettes, reed cases, ink wells as craftsman signatures
2025-08-08 18:19:08 [claude-sonnet-4] The glyph embodies both the physical act (fiber twisting) and intellectual status
2025-08-08 18:19:08 [claude-sonnet-4] (literacy/wisdom) of scribes.
