2025-08-10 11:34:10 [deepseek-chat] 1. Historical First: The first script for Slavic languages, tied to Christianization of
2025-08-10 11:34:10 [deepseek-chat] Eastern Europe.
2025-08-10 11:34:10 [deepseek-chat] 2. Aesthetic: Distinctive loopy design (unlike Cyrillic or Latin).
2025-08-10 11:34:10 [deepseek-chat] 3. Rarity: Mostly obsolete but culturally revered (Croatian Catholic liturgy still uses it
2025-08-10 11:34:10 [deepseek-chat] occasionally).
