2025-08-10 13:02:59 [kimi-k2-turbo] 1. Swap `res.push(c)` for `res.push(line[i])` so you emit the original character (e.g.,
2025-08-10 13:02:59 [kimi-k2-turbo] punctuation) rather than its code point.
