2025-08-10 14:06:41 [claude-opus-4-1] • History Management*: Sophisticated conversation history tracking with support for
2025-08-10 14:06:41 [claude-opus-4-1] squashing, saving/loading sessions, and different formatting modes (strict, multi, inline).
2025-08-10 14:06:41 [claude-opus-4-1] • File Sharing System*: Robust file sharing with hashing, versioning, and tag-based
2025-08-10 14:06:41 [claude-opus-4-1] organization.
2025-08-10 14:06:41 [claude-opus-4-1] Notable Features
