2025-08-10 14:06:41 [claude-opus-4-1] - Raw Mode Input: Custom prompt implementation with raw terminal input handling
2025-08-10 14:06:41 [claude-opus-4-1] - Worker Support: Integration with `.slop.ts` worker scripts
2025-08-10 14:06:41 [claude-opus-4-1] Code Quality
