2025-08-12 10:03:08 [deepseek-chat] Yes, `ammo.js` is a direct port of the Bullet Physics Engine to JavaScript (via
2025-08-12 10:03:08 [deepseek-chat] Emscripten). It’s not an original repository but a automated build of Bullet for use in
2025-08-12 10:03:08 [deepseek-chat] WebGL/JavaScript applications.
2025-08-12 10:03:08 [deepseek-chat] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
