2025-08-12 10:03:08 [deepseek-chat] 1. Source:
2025-08-12 10:03:08 [deepseek-chat]    - Derived from [Bullet Physics](https://github.com/bulletphysics/bullet3) (C++).
2025-08-12 10:03:08 [deepseek-chat]    - Compiled to JavaScript using Emscripten.
2025-08-12 10:03:08 [deepseek-chat] 2. Purpose:
2025-08-12 10:03:08 [deepseek-chat]    - Provides physics (collision, rigid bodies, constraints) for web-based 3D apps (e.g., Three.js,
2025-08-12 10:03:08 [deepseek-chat] Babylon.js).
