2025-08-12 10:03:08 [deepseek-chat]    - The canonical version is maintained here:
2025-08-12 10:03:08 [deepseek-chat]      → [kripken/ammo.js](https://github.com/kripken/ammo.js) (by Alon Zakai, creator of
2025-08-12 10:03:08 [deepseek-chat] Emscripten).
