2025-08-12 10:28:03 [deepseek-chat] Here's the bulletproof way to get the remote URL in a batch file:
2025-08-12 10:28:03 [deepseek-chat] @echo off
2025-08-12 10:28:03 [deepseek-chat] for /D %%D in ("nitrologic\*") do (
2025-08-12 10:28:03 [deepseek-chat]     if exist "%%D\.git" (
2025-08-12 10:28:03 [deepseek-chat]         for /f "delims=" %%R in ('git --git-dir="%%D\.git" config --get remote.origin.url 2^>nul') do (
2025-08-12 10:28:03 [deepseek-chat]             echo URL: %%R
2025-08-12 10:28:03 [deepseek-chat]         )
2025-08-12 10:28:03 [deepseek-chat]     )
2025-08-12 10:28:03 [deepseek-chat] )
2025-08-12 10:28:03 [deepseek-chat] Key Fixes:
2025-08-12 10:28:03 [deepseek-chat] 1. Missing single quotes around the git command
2025-08-12 10:28:03 [deepseek-chat]    - Wrong: `(git --git-dir=...)`
2025-08-12 10:28:03 [deepseek-chat]    - Right: `('git --git-dir=...')`
2025-08-12 10:28:04 [deepseek-chat] 2. Error suppression with `2>nul` (escaped as `2^>nul` in `for /f`)
2025-08-12 10:28:04 [deepseek-chat] 3. `delims=` preserves URLs with spaces/special chars
2025-08-12 10:28:04 [deepseek-chat] Alternative (More Reliable):
2025-08-12 10:28:04 [deepseek-chat] @echo off
2025-08-12 10:28:04 [deepseek-chat] for /f "delims=" %%D in ('dir /b /ad "nitrologic\*"') do (
2025-08-12 10:28:04 [deepseek-chat]     if exist "nitrologic\%%D\.git" (
2025-08-12 10:28:04 [deepseek-chat]         for /f "delims=" %%R in ('cd /d "nitrologic\%%D" ^&^& git config --get remote.origin.url') do (
2025-08-12 10:28:04 [deepseek-chat]             echo %%D: %%R
2025-08-12 10:28:04 [deepseek-chat]         )
2025-08-12 10:28:04 [deepseek-chat]     )
2025-08-12 10:28:04 [deepseek-chat] )
2025-08-12 10:28:04 [deepseek-chat] Why This Works:
2025-08-12 10:28:04 [deepseek-chat] - Uses `dir /b` for safer directory iteration
2025-08-12 10:28:04 [deepseek-chat] - Changes directory before running git (avoids `--git-dir` issues)
2025-08-12 10:28:04 [deepseek-chat] - Handles paths with spaces perfectly
2025-08-12 10:28:04 [deepseek-chat] Example Output:
2025-08-12 10:28:04 [deepseek-chat] blitz2: https://github.com/nitrologic/blitz2.git
2025-08-12 10:28:04 [deepseek-chat] blitz3d: https://github.com/nitrologic/blitz3d.git
