2025-08-13 09:42:38 [deepseek-chat] 1. Flexibility:
2025-08-13 09:42:38 [deepseek-chat]    - Some circuits span multiple years (e.g., "Late 1970s" or "1980–1985").
2025-08-13 09:42:38 [deepseek-chat]    - Avoids false precision when exact years are unknown.
2025-08-13 09:42:38 [deepseek-chat] 2. Historical Context:
2025-08-13 09:42:38 [deepseek-chat]    - Better for eras (e.g., `"period": "Analog Synth Golden Age (1970s)"`).
2025-08-13 09:42:38 [deepseek-chat] 3. Forward Compatibility:
2025-08-13 09:42:38 [deepseek-chat]    - Ready for non-year periods (e.g., `"period": "Vacuum Tube Era"`).
