2025-08-16 09:17:58 [deepseek-chat] The term "sprawl" typically refers to urban sprawl, which describes the
2025-08-16 09:17:58 [deepseek-chat] uncontrolled, often low-density expansion of cities into surrounding rural areas.
2025-08-16 09:17:58 [deepseek-chat] Key Origins:
