2025-08-16 11:17:52 [deepseek-chat] For sending keyup events for cursor (arrow) keys, you'll typically need platform-specific
2025-08-16 11:17:52 [deepseek-chat] tools or libraries. Here are a few options:
2025-08-16 11:17:52 [deepseek-chat] Linux (X11/Wayland)
2025-08-16 11:17:52 [deepseek-chat] Use `xdotool` (X11) or `ydotool` (Wayland):
2025-08-16 11:17:52 [deepseek-chat]  Send UP arrow keydown + keyup (X11)
