2025-08-16 11:17:52 [deepseek-chat]  For Wayland (ydotool)
2025-08-16 11:17:52 [deepseek-chat] ydotool key 103:1 103:0  # 103 = Up arrow (1=press, 0=release)
2025-08-16 11:17:52 [deepseek-chat] macOS
2025-08-16 11:17:52 [deepseek-chat] Use `cliclick` or AppleScript:
