2025-08-16 11:24:59 [deepseek-chat] using ANSI escape codes:
2025-08-16 11:24:59 [deepseek-chat] Key Concepts
2025-08-16 11:24:59 [deepseek-chat] 1. Save/Restore Cursor Position:
2025-08-16 11:24:59 [deepseek-chat]    const SAVE_CURSOR = '\x1B[s';
2025-08-16 11:24:59 [deepseek-chat]    const RESTORE_CURSOR = '\x1B[u';
2025-08-16 11:24:59 [deepseek-chat] 2. Line Clearing:
2025-08-16 11:24:59 [deepseek-chat]    const CLEAR_LINE = '\x1B[2K';
2025-08-16 11:24:59 [deepseek-chat] Implementation Example
2025-08-16 11:24:59 [deepseek-chat] let historyIndex = -1; // -1 means "not browsing history"
2025-08-16 11:24:59 [deepseek-chat] async function navigateHistory(direction: 'up'|'down') {
2025-08-16 11:24:59 [deepseek-chat]     // Save current input if we're just starting history navigation
2025-08-16 11:24:59 [deepseek-chat]     if (historyIndex === -1 && direction === 'up') {
