2025-08-20 08:46:56 [deepseek-chat] • Reasons:*
2025-08-20 08:46:56 [deepseek-chat] - ASCII is the proper standard for 0-127 (ANSI extended beyond this)
2025-08-20 08:46:56 [deepseek-chat] - ASCII names are universally recognized (NUL, SOH, STX, etc.)
2025-08-20 08:46:56 [deepseek-chat] - Maintains technical accuracy
2025-08-20 08:46:56 [deepseek-chat] - Avoids confusion with extended ANSI/ISO characters (128-255)
