2025-08-20 08:46:56 [deepseek-chat]   "1": {"name": "SOH", "description": "Start of Heading"},
2025-08-20 08:46:56 [deepseek-chat]   "32": {"name": "Space", "description": "Space"},
2025-08-20 08:46:56 [deepseek-chat]   "126": {"name": "Tilde", "description": "Tilde"}
2025-08-20 08:46:56 [deepseek-chat] }
2025-08-20 08:46:56 [deepseek-chat] ASCII provides the canonical names for this range.
