2025-08-20 08:51:10 [deepseek-chat] • Encoding notes:*
2025-08-20 08:51:10 [deepseek-chat] - Use Unicode escape sequences (`\u001B` for ESC)
2025-08-20 08:51:10 [deepseek-chat] - Some terminals use different sequences (VT100 vs xterm)
2025-08-20 08:51:10 [deepseek-chat] - Include common variants if needed
2025-08-20 08:51:10 [deepseek-chat] - Values are the actual bytes terminals receive
2025-08-20 08:51:10 [deepseek-chat] This captures the raw ANSI sequences that applications would detect.
