2025-08-22 09:57:07 [gpt-5-mini] - Collects a JS array of byte values (numbers 0–255) called bytes, wraps it into a Uint8Array, then
2025-08-22 09:57:07 [gpt-5-mini] writes it to the stdout WritableStream writer and awaits stream readiness.
