2025-08-22 15:04:47 [deepseek-chat] To enable Unicode paste in Deno's raw mode on Windows, you can use the following command:
2025-08-22 15:04:47 [deepseek-chat] deno run --allow-read --allow-write your_script.ts
2025-08-22 15:04:47 [deepseek-chat] However, if you're specifically looking to handle raw terminal input with Unicode support, you
2025-08-22 15:04:47 [deepseek-chat] might need to use a library like `deno.land/x/input` or implement custom handling since Deno's
2025-08-22 15:04:47 [deepseek-chat] built-in `readLine` doesn't natively support raw mode with Unicode on Windows.
2025-08-22 15:04:47 [deepseek-chat] For a more robust solution, consider using:
2025-08-22 15:04:47 [deepseek-chat] import { readKeypress } from "https://deno.land/x/keypress@0.0.11/mod.ts";
2025-08-22 15:04:47 [deepseek-chat] for await (const keypress of readKeypress()) {
