2025-08-22 15:06:19 [deepseek-chat] For wobbly or "quasi" box drawing characters, you might be looking for characters from the "Box
2025-08-22 15:06:19 [deepseek-chat] Drawing" block that have a wavy or curved appearance. Here are some Unicode code points:
2025-08-22 15:06:19 [deepseek-chat] • Horizontal wavy lines:*
2025-08-22 15:06:19 [deepseek-chat] - ⎺ (U+23BA) - Horizontal Scan Line-1
2025-08-22 15:06:19 [deepseek-chat] - ⎻ (U+23BB) - Horizontal Scan Line-3
2025-08-22 15:06:19 [deepseek-chat] - ⎼ (U+23BC) - Horizontal Scan Line-7
2025-08-22 15:06:19 [deepseek-chat] - ⎽ (U+23BD) - Horizontal Scan Line-9
2025-08-22 15:06:19 [deepseek-chat] • Vertical wavy lines:*
2025-08-22 15:06:19 [deepseek-chat] - ⎹ (U+23B9) - Vertical Line Extension
2025-08-22 15:06:19 [deepseek-chat] These are typically used for scan lines but can give a wobbly appearance. For more traditional wavy
2025-08-22 15:06:19 [deepseek-chat] box drawing, you might need to combine these or use other characters.
2025-08-22 15:06:19 [deepseek-chat] Example usage:
2025-08-22 15:06:19 [deepseek-chat] console.log("\u23BA"); // ⎺
2025-08-22 15:06:19 [deepseek-chat] console.log("\u23B9"); // ⎹
