2025-08-22 15:07:04 [deepseek-chat] - ┆ (U+2506) - Box Drawings Light Triple Dash Vertical
2025-08-22 15:07:04 [deepseek-chat] - ┇ (U+2507) - Box Drawings Heavy Triple Dash Vertical
2025-08-22 15:07:04 [deepseek-chat] - ┊ (U+250A) - Box Drawings Light Quadruple Dash Vertical
